{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216090","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1721609001:0":{"text":"これが、あなたたちの言う守備軍らしさですか？ぬいぐるみ遊びをする私にすら勝てないあなたたちに、守備軍を語る資格はありません。","source_cn":"看来，你们的标准出了点问题。连我这个玩玩偶的人都打不过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DF02B7CCAB0FD0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721609002:0":{"text":"あ、ありえねえ……あんたなんて、ただの……","source_cn":"这……这不可能……你明明是个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26F8EFB496791141","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721609003:0":{"text":"いいですか。守備軍に「基準」などありません。守るべきものを守り、勝つべきときに勝てる者こそが守備軍です！","source_cn":"听好了！守备军没有标准的模样，只要能守护该守护的人，只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3F889171DE0AEAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721609004:0":{"text":"まだ異論のある者はいますか？","source_cn":"还有人有异议吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB8D9620D065E39F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721609005:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721609006:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721609007:0":{"text":"では規則どおり、明日の朝、重りをつけて訓練場を二十周走ること。","source_cn":"既然输了，就按规矩办。明早负重跑20圈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37A14F2F4E47BCB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721609008:2":{"text":"……はい。","source_cn":"……是。<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACCA27AAFC18A113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721609009:0":{"text":"……分かりました。","source_cn":"……遵命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3D78BE0F04804AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721609010:0":{"text":"ギイとホーレンは互いに肩を貸し合い、みじめな姿で去っていった。訓練場には、再びグウィネスだけが残った。","source_cn":"盖伊和呼伦相互搀扶着狼狈离开，训练场又只剩下的格温妮丝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB75E57D7BC4A19EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721609011:1":{"text":"（ギイとホーレンの言い分は不愉快だったけれど、貴族のお嬢様と言われて、ひとつ思い出したことがあるわ）","source_cn":"（虽说盖伊和呼伦说的话并不好听，不过正牌的贵族小姐么…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64